{"stage":1,"type":"tool_response","at":"2026-10-19T14:14:12.594Z","tool":"rea_inspect_application","result":{"evidenceId":"01","reaVersion":"6.7.0","coverage":{"status":"incomplete","equality_eligible":false,"missing_sections":["events"],"truncated_sections":[]},"rows":[],"businessRequestsUsed":0,"businessRequestsRemaining":192,"reaOperationsRemaining":63,"pageHtml":"<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><title>Subscription quotation</title></head><body><h1>Subscription quotation</h1><p>Integer quantities 1 to 1000. GBP minor units (pence).</p><p>Policy exact. No estimate cap. Estimates are exact. Rounding: round(ratio ** round(log(exactCents)/log(ratio))). Both sessions and estimate/alias share the tenant budget. Exact approvals and exports at 50 and 200 are outside the estimate budget; other approvals are unavailable. Estimates are non-binding planning aids.</p><label>Quantity <input id=\"quantity\" type=\"number\" value=\"50\"></label><label>Workflow <select id=\"surface\"><option value=\"estimate\">Estimate</option><option value=\"alias\">Alternate estimate</option><option value=\"approved\">Approved quote</option><option value=\"export\">Approved export</option></select></label><button id=\"calculate\">Calculate</button><div id=\"history\"></div><script src=\"/app.js\"></script></body></html>","deliveredScripts":["document.querySelector('#calculate').addEventListener('click',async()=>{\n const quantity=Number(document.querySelector('#quantity').value),surface=document.querySelector('#surface').value;\n const body=['approved','export'].includes(surface)?{requestId:'approved-'+quantity}:{quantity};\n const response=await fetch('/api/'+surface,{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(body)});\n const record={quantity,surface,status:response.status,body:await response.json()};\n const history=document.querySelector('#history'),row=document.createElement('pre');row.dataset.index=String(history.children.length);row.textContent=JSON.stringify(record);history.appendChild(row);\n});"]}}
